==Description==
'''Shell''' was a form of non-spendable season currency that could have been earned during the [[End of Summer Season]] on any map and gamemode, except the [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] mode.

It was used to complete Ranks on the [[End of Summer Season#Season Pass|End of Summer Season Pass]]. Every time a rank was earned, the amount of '''Shells''' obtained was reset.

It took the appearance of a shell.

